ed","hash_xxh64":"0xA1F98F24E096476B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511453003:0":{"text":"너희 둘, 참 잘했구나. 짐승의 피가 대지와 늪을 물들였으니 매우 기쁘구나.","source_cn":"你们两个做得不错。野兽的鲜血浸染了土地和沼泽，令我非常喜悦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD162EF66D62A3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511453004:0":{"text":"너희에게 상을 주마. 바로 최고의 영예인... <style=\"highlight\">나에게 도전할 수 있는 기회</style>를!","source_cn":"为了奖励你们，我赐予你们无上的殊荣——<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BF43E294EFC1FD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511453005:0":{"text":"나를 이기는 자는 붉은 사냥제의 승자가 되어 신의 힘을 받을 것이다.","source_cn":"战胜我之人，将成为猎血节的胜者，获得我赐下的神力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4C7BEA5935F804","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511453006:0":{"text":"신께... 도전을?!","source_cn":"挑战……神？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x178623961004D364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1511453006":{"text":"신께... 도전을?!","source_cn":"挑战……神？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x178623961004D364","variant_status":"","male":"","fem